{"parse":{"title":"Unwavering Ardor","pageid":491546,"revid":2189623,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Unwavering Ardor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5c/Constellation_Unwavering_Ardor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031106\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Unwavering Ardor\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5c/Constellation_Unwavering_Ardor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031106\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5c/Constellation_Unwavering_Ardor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031106 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/5c/Constellation_Unwavering_Ardor.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031106 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Unwavering Ardor\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Unwavering_Ardor.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Unwavering Ardor.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Nobleborn%27s_Charge\" title=\"The Nobleborn&#39;s Charge\">The Nobleborn's Charge</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">-</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tapping on Normal Attack or Elemental Skill in the 5s after Vesna uses <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Windborne Sword</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Windborne Sword</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">When in the Armed for Action mode, Vesna can consume Sword Essence to use her special Elemental Skill to deal <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>.<br />Each use of the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword in the same instance of Armed for Action will increase the level of Windborne Sword, beginning from Lv. 1, up to Lv. 3 max.<br />Using Windborne Sword at Lv. 2 and Lv. 3 will also summon a Spirit Blade which deals <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>.</span></span></span> at its highest level will unleash the secret Vila ability Windborne Sword: Transpose, dealing <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> at 150% of Vesna's ATK as well as summoning <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Spirit Blades</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Spirit Blade</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">A weapon with special power that Vesna can summon. Attacks the opponent alongside Vesna to deal <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>.<br />Vesna can summon Spirit Blades through the following ways:<br /><ul><li>By unleashing the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword at Lv. 2 and Lv. 3;</li><li>By using the Elemental Burst For the Tsaritsa!; or</li><li>By using Windborne Sword·: Transpose in the Constellation Unwavering Ardor.<br /><br />Radiance: Stellar Swirl: DMG dealt by the Spirit Blades become <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> that is considered Stellar Swirl reaction DMG instead.</li></ul></span></span></span> which deal an additional instance of <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> at 200% of Vesna's ATK. If Vesna is in the <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Armed for Action</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Armed for Action</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Vesna switches to this mode after using the Elemental Skill The Art of Victory. In this mode, which lasts up to 15s:<br /><ul><li>Vesna's resistance to interruption is increased.</li><li>DMG dealt by Vesna with her Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, and Plunging Attacks becomes <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> that cannot be overridden by another elemental infusion instead. She will also summon a wind pinion that attacks the opponent at the same time, dealing additional <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>. Each time the wind pinion is summoned, Vesna will regenerate a certain amount of Sword Essence.</li><li>Vesna can consume Sword Essence to unleash the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword, which deals <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> to her opponents.</li><li>Vesna will exit the mode when its duration ends or after she has used Windborne Sword at the highest level 3 times. Exiting will clear all remaining Sword Essence she has accrued.</li></ul></span></span></span> mode, she will also summon a wind pinion to perform Coordinated Attacks against opponents.<br />Additionally, Vesna's Stellar Swirl reaction DMG dealt is <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">elevated</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Elevation</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects.</span></span></span> by 20%.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Unwavering Ardor</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_6_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 6 Constellation\">Level 6 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnwavering_Ardor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Unwavering Ardor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">不移的赤忱</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不移的赤忱</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">揺るぎなき忠誠</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">변치</span> <span lang=\"ko\">않는</span> <span lang=\"ko\">충심</span><br /><small><i>Byeonchi Anneun Chungsim</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Entusiasmo inquebrantable</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Ardeur in<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>branlable</td><td>Unwavering Ardor</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Непоколебимое</span> <span lang=\"ru\">рвение</span><br /><small><i>Nepokolebimoye rveniye</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Unwavering Ardor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Tấm Lòng Sắt Son</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Unersch<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>tterliche Hingabe</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Unwavering Ardor</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Paix<span lang=\"pt\">ã</span>o Inabal<span lang=\"pt\">á</span>vel</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Sars<span lang=\"tr\">ı</span>lmaz Sadakat</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Ardore incrollabile</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnwavering_Ardor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a href=\"/wiki/Version/7.1\"